  m_Name: MarkBeesly_Log03
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LogData
  subject: Oxygen airflow system maintenance, Room 116.
  log: III
  date: June 5th, 20XX
  author: Mark Beesly
  message: 'Called-in by a spaced out artist type. He stared at me the whole time.
    Circled the room trying to find the backup filter. It was not in its regular
    place. Installed new particle filter. Immediately got another call. Promptly
    left. Maintenance time: 4 minutes. Issue: dirty filter.'
